  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-09-06 (walk-through item 4): re-scope ACCEPTED as recommended. INV-hosig FOLDED into INV-bikaj as its named instance (duplicate_of link; invariants have no wont_do, so its status stays as filed and it leaves `ready`); INV-hujog stays the prerequisite; umbrella re-titled to the mechanism; P2 -> P3 (owner-authorised: it moves no analysis result, 4.5% of pass time on the 8-repo cohort). The mechanism (INV-hujog -> INV-bikaj) is appended to the END of the arc tail."  # 1ecb
- op: discuss  # 03cd
  at: '2026-09-16T19:27:55Z'  # 03cd
  by: agent  # 03cd
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 03cd
  clock: 10  # 03cd
  nonce: 03cd  # 03cd
  message: "RE-VERIFIED AT TIP 2026-09-16 (dev db846f196f). BOTH HALVES OF THIS UMBRELLA'S\nSTATEMENT NOW HAVE A PRECISE ANSWER, AND ONE OF THEM IS THAT THE MECHANISM THIS\nITEM ASKS FOR ALREADY EXISTED WHEN THE ITEM WAS FILED.\n\nHALF (a), THE ACTIVATION PREDICATE. The statement asks that \"passes should\nconsult an activation predicate (analogous to a\nshould_run(detected_frameworks, detected_languages) check) and short-circuit\nwhen their target patterns are absent.\"\n\nThat predicate exists, with that name and that exact signature:\nLinkerActivation.should_run(detected_frameworks: set[str],\ndetected_languages: set[str]) -> bool, in linkers/registry.py, per ADR-3aaa.\nIt is ENFORCED, not decorative: run_all_linkers filters to active_linkers via\nlinker.activation.should_run(...) before dispatch. `git log -S` dates both the\nclass and the gating call to 55296f5440, 2026-01-30 (\"feat: implement ADR-0010\nmodular packages\") -- FOUR MONTHS BEFORE this item was filed on 2026-05-30. The\numbrella was filed against a mechanism already shipped and already wired.\n\nWHAT THE UMBRELLA ACTUALLY OWNS, therefore, is not \"build the gate\" but the\nDEFAULT. Census at tip, by AST over every register_linker call, 61 linkers:\n    24  genuinely gated (frameworks=... / language_pairs=...)\n    12  explicit activation=LinkerActivation(always=True) -- a deliberate,\n        readable \"this is a protocol linker, it always runs\"\n    25  NO activation= argument at all -> register_linker defaults to\n        LinkerActivation(always=True)\nSo 37 of 61 run unconditionally and 25 of those never said so. The permissive\nvalue is the DEFAULT, which makes \"nobody decided\" indistinguishable from \"we\ndecided it always runs\" -- the absent-versus-empty shape again, at the\nregistration site. All three linkers in WI-finij's silent cohort\n(graphql-resolver, message-queue, ipc) are in the defaulted 25.\ndi-resolution-linker (INV-hosig) is in the explicit 12.\n\nCOST, so the gate question is decidable rather than rhetorical. Post-fix\nself-survey at tip, 97 runs / 207647 ms pass time: the passes that read files\nand emitted nothing total 9922 ms = 4.78% of pass time, across 11 runs.\nNOT PERFORMED, DELIBERATELY: tightening an activation gate is the WITHHOLDING\ndirection. If framework detection misses, the linker does not run and real edges\ndisappear with no diagnostic. Trading recall for 4.78% of pass time is an owner\ndecision and wants bakeoff validation, so it is surfaced here with the numbers\nrather than shipped.\n\nHALF (b), THE RECORDED REASON. Shipped (silence_reason, INV-bikaj), and this\nsession found it was producing a FALSE reason. derive_silence_reason reads\nfiles_analyzed == 0 as the positive claim \"received zero input files\", but 0 is\nalso the dataclass default: EIGHT linkers read 14 to 834 files apiece, reported\n0, and were stamped no_candidate_files -- including di-resolution, this\numbrella's own named instance. Fixed in PR #1005 by deriving the count at the\nlinker chokepoint, with a gate against reintroduction. Distribution at tip moved\nno_candidate_files 51 -> 43, unreported 3 -> 11. Detail on WI-finij / INV-hosig.\nStill open on this half: 5 of the 7 declared silence values have NO producer,\nand 3 of those have free-text twins already in limits.skipped_passes (one\nconcept, two channels) -- WI-finij.\n\nMEMBER STATE, opened individually rather than inferred from each other:\n  INV-babuj  satisfied\n  INV-kodan  satisfied\n  INV-bikaj  SATISFIED 2026-09-16 (instrumentation shipped); residual WI-finij\n  INV-hosig  violated, folded into INV-bikaj; root_cause corrected today\n  INV-hujog  violated, owner-deferred -- and its re-open trigger CANNOT FIRE\n             (prerequisite_absent has no producer); recorded on that item\nStatus unchanged (violated)."  # 03cd
